imes New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;line-height:1.15;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The Company maintains an institutional banking line of credit for $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_2b947dbc-08c0-4aa5-8257-30a087f473ba" contextRef="C_81255a2f-2cd7-4e1b-b289-df5c71a0e6fd" name="us-gaap:LineOfCredit" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million and in connection with the line of credit, the Company was required to pledge $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_565fd7b4-c80b-4fb7-8c54-155b890f7f1b" contextRef="C_81255a2f-2cd7-4e1b-b289-df5c71a0e6fd" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCollateralAmount" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">of its cash and cash equivalents as collateral. The</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
